  "text": "### 9. Resource Requirements  \n**Staffing:**\n- Head of Internal Audit (1 FTE)\n- Internal Auditors (1–2 FTE, depending on scope)\n- Specialist consultants as needed (technology audit, forensics)  \n**Skills Required:**\n- Accounting/financial controls knowledge\n- Risk management understanding\n- Process mapping and analysis\n- IT controls knowledge (databases, systems)\n- Regulatory compliance knowledge\n- Communication skills (report writing)  \n**Development:**\n- Auditor certifications (CIA, CISA, etc.)\n- Continuous professional education\n- Training budget allocated  \n**Budget:**\n- Salaries and benefits (approved by Board)\n- External consultants as needed\n- Training and certifications\n- Audit software and tools  \n---",
